# act secrets — copy to .act.secrets (make act-init). NEVER commit the real file.
#
# THIS FILE SHOULD STAY EMPTY FOR THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# ci.yml declares no secrets at all: this package has no database, no registry
# step and no publish path in CI. `make ci` therefore runs act directly rather
# than under `infisical run`, which differs from the sibling repositories for
# that reason and no other.
#
# publish.yml does need credentials, but act never runs it — see .actrc.
